\ crypto/dilithium_vectors.fam — tabminer's values for crypto/keccak.fam and
\ crypto/dilithium.fam (docs/GUI_WALLET.md, phase 1).  Written by
\ miner/src/fam_dilithium_vectors.rs (`cargo test --release --features dev
\ --lib write_fam_dilithium_vectors -- --ignored`); not to be edited.  Read by
\ crypto/dilithium_test.fam.
\
\ dvkn ( -- n )  the hash cases; dvk ( i -- )  case i: dvkf the function
\ (0 SHAKE128, 1 SHAKE256, 2 SHA3-256, 3 SHA3-512), dvkl the input's
\ length (byte j of it 7j+1), dvko the output's, its bytes at dvkx.
\ dvn ( -- n )  the Dilithium cases; dvset ( i -- )  case i: the seed at
\ dvsd (32), the message at dvmsg (dvml bytes), the context at dvctx
\ (dvcl), SHAKE256-256 of the public key, secret key and signature at
\ dvpkh dvskh dvsgh, and the checks at dvt (dvtn of them, four words
\ each: kind, a, b, tabminer's verdict -1 or 0; the kinds as
\ fam_dilithium_vectors.rs's checks).

: dvp variable ;  : dvkf variable ;  : dvkl variable ;  : dvko variable ;  : dvkx variable ;
: dvsd variable ;  : dvmsg variable ;  : dvml variable ;  : dvctx variable ;  : dvcl variable ;
: dvpkh variable ;  : dvskh variable ;  : dvsgh variable ;  : dvt variable ;  : dvtn variable ;
: dvc  dvp @ c!  dvp @ 1 lit + dvp ! ;
: dvbufs
dvkx @ 0= if
	100 lit alloc dvkx !  20 lit alloc dvsd !  100 lit alloc dvmsg !  110 lit alloc dvctx !
	20 lit alloc dvpkh !  20 lit alloc dvskh !  20 lit alloc dvsgh !  200 lit alloc dvt !
then ;
: dvck  dvtn @ 4 lit lshift dvt @ + tuck C lit + !  tuck 8 lit + !  tuck 4 lit + !  !  dvtn @ 1 lit + dvtn ! ;   \ ( kind a b verdict -- )

